      "code_snippet": "\n## Expiry\n\nUntil the visitor leaves with `[0]`, or the session ends. Announce the lapse in plain prose so the pilot knows they are talking to their own agent again. `disown welcome-tour` ends it mid-tour.\n\n## Consent\n",
